# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repo nay CHI theo doi ma nguon. Toan bo du lieu bai giang (.docx/.pptx/.rar)
# va ket qua sinh ra (audio/anh/clip/video) deu bi loai tru - dung lam kho
# GitHub phinh to hang GB. Chien luoc: chan tat ca, roi mo lai tung file code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/requirements.txt
!/make_videos.py
!/export_all_slides.py
!/TTS_VieNeu_KichBan_4.1.ipynb
!/docs/
!/.github/

# Phong ho: du co lo tay `git add -f`, cac duoi file nang van bi chan
*.rar
*.zip
*.docx
*.pptx
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.png
*.jpg
*.pdf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
VIDEO_OUTPUT/
outputs*/
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ...tru anh dung cho trang docs
!/docs/**/*.png
!/docs/**/*.jpg
